---
title: Local architecture (design view). Dashed = planned (M4) or from M3, not built.
---
flowchart LR
  subgraph MAC["Mac, no Juice Shop installed"]
    CMD["Loop commands<br/>one command per step"]
    DESK["OpenHands desktop app<br/>window only, from M3"]
  end

  subgraph DOCKER["Docker: labelled project=governed-remediation, loopback only"]
    SCAN["Scanners<br/>Semgrep, Trivy, ZAP"]
    OUT[("Output folder<br/>SARIF, evidence, logs")]
    PROD["Juice Shop: production<br/>127.0.0.1:3000"]
    EXP["Exploit runner"]
    FIX["OpenHands fixer, in a sandbox<br/>works on a throwaway copy<br/>that keeps codefixes and snippets"]
    PRB["Pull request build<br/>throwaway container, test runner"]
    TRI["Triage agent<br/>works on a throwaway copy<br/>with snippet comments stripped<br/>planned (M4)"]
    JEN["Jenkins<br/>from M3"]
  end

  subgraph GH["GitHub repo"]
    ISS["Issues: the ticket store<br/>one per file, line and CWE"]
    PR["Pull requests with evidence"]
    MAIN["main branch"]
    LED["Memory ledger and cross-references<br/>decisions from collaborators only<br/>planned (M4)"]
  end

  H(("Human approver"))
  MODEL["Model API<br/>Anthropic first, Bedrock from M3"]

  CMD -->|scan| SCAN --> OUT
  CMD -->|ticket| ISS
  CMD -->|exploit| EXP --> PROD
  CMD -->|fix| FIX --> PR
  FIX -.-> MODEL
  PR -->|verify| PRB
  PR --> H -->|merge| MAIN
  MAIN -->|deploy| PROD
  DESK -.-> FIX
  JEN -.->|replaces the verify and deploy scripts| PRB
  ISS -.-> TRI
  TRI -.->|verdict comment| ISS
  TRI -.-> MODEL
  ISS -.-> LED

  classDef planned fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#534AB7,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#26215C
  class TRI,LED,JEN,DESK planned
